# Mermaid diagram layout

Draw Mermaid diagrams top to bottom when that layout stays readable. A left-to-right row compresses node labels on the page.

- Flowcharts start with `flowchart TD`.
- State diagrams set `direction TB` on the line after `stateDiagram-v2`.
- Keep the existing node labels and edge labels when changing direction.
- Use `flowchart LR` or `direction LR` only when a vertical layout cannot show the relationship clearly.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  corp["Corporate network"]
  hub["ACM hub in Azure"]
  corp -->|"private link"| hub
```

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> ServingOnNode1
  ServingOnNode1 --> TolerationWindow: Node 1 is not ready
```
